    <briefdescription>
<para>A single CDC event encoded with the Confluent wire format. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_schema_encoded_event_1aacc779d92955b2d6dadc33d49ddf83a9" kindref="member">payload</ref></computeroutput> field contains the full wire-format bytes (magic byte + 4-byte schema ID + serialised event body). Downstream Kafka producers, Kafka Connect sinks, and other Confluent-compatible consumers can decode this directly. </para>
